.Dd February 1, 2026
.Dt VFS_REGISTER_FILESYSTEM 9
.Os Substrate
.Sh NAME
.Nm vfs_register_filesystem
.Nd register a filesystem driver
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In vfs/vfs.h
.Ft void
.Fn vfs_register_filesystem "filesystem_t *fs"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn vfs_register_filesystem
function registers a new filesystem driver with the VFS kernel subsystem.
The
.Fa fs
argument must point to a populated
.Vt filesystem_t
structure, which includes the filesystem name and a mount callback function.
.Pp
Registered filesystems are available for use by
.Fn vfs_mount .
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr vfs 9 ,
.Xr vfs_mount 9
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Fn vfs_register_filesystem
function appeared in Substrate.
